  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 38948bbc0f96de7498bb32b64efae4ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: J2 - Mail Connor
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: "It\u2019s me again!"
  character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 54bf09c5b5fdced4fb15b8f856b441f3, type: 2}
  hasDelay: 0
  hasRandomDelay: 0
  delay: 0
  maxDelay: 0
  mailText: "<size=12>Hey, it's your boy Connor!\n\nDidn't forget about me, right?
    Chill guy with the cool vest?\n\nWell, you know what? You seem alright, so I\u2019m
    gonna clue you in on a lil' something.\n\nTomorrow, company\u2019s about to hand
    over some long-overdue promotions to its best soldiers. And of course, duty will
    fall on you to decide who\u2019s most deserving of the honors.\n\nI know! Might
    be overwhelming to already undertake responsibilities like this just as you came
    in. I mean, you don\u2019t even know anyone here, and it\u2019s not like you
    got anyone rooting for you.\n\nIf anything, most of them will want to tear you
    apart as soon as you give them a warning. Can\u2019t please everyone!\n\nBut
    earning a few friends here and there can go a long way towards making you fit
    in.\n\nAnyways, just my two cents.\n\nAnd remember: <b>I am</b> rooting for you,
    pal!"
